---
// Company-level facts and operating principles are drawn from the reworked
// 2029+ portfolio. The DBA names are proposals, not separate legal entities.
---

<section class="section about-section" id="about" data-theme="corporate">
  <div class="background-layer">
    <div class="parallax-bg"></div>
    <div class="corporate-flux"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="content-layer">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-header observe-fade">
        <p class="about-eyebrow">Company structure</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">One corporation. Four staged operating lines.</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">A trade-led, one-owner micro-enterprise designed to integrate with a future homestead.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="legal-status observe-fade">
        <span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p>
          <strong>Fluxology, Inc. is federally incorporated and registered to operate in Ontario.</strong>
          The four operating names presented on this site are proposed and have not yet been registered.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-content observe-slide-up">
        <div class="about-text">
          <p class="about-paragraph">
            Fluxology is not a holding company, staffing plan or collection of separate corporations. It is one
            Canadian-controlled private corporation with internal cost centres for repair and fabrication, digital
            production support, protected growing, and perennial food systems.
          </p>

          <p class="about-paragraph">
            The plan begins with mobile/local welding no earlier than 2029, while the owner continues separate T4
            trade employment. The 3D Lab starts as a compact internal capability and becomes a public service only
            after demand is proven. The greenhouse and orchard begin after a compatible homestead is acquired and
            prioritize household food, preservation and propagation before any sale.
          </p>

          <p class="about-paragraph about-paragraph--accent">
            Growth is allowed to move later. It is not allowed to become larger, more leveraged or more labour-heavy
            merely to preserve a date or forecast.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-values">
          <h3 class="values-title">Operating principles</h3>
          <ul class="values-list" role="list">
            <li class="value-item">
              <img
                src="/images/corporate/value-excellence.webp"
                alt="Polished achievement trophy"
                width="360"
                height="360"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              />
              <span><strong>Controlled scope</strong> Accept only work that fits qualification, access, schedule, insurance and one-person capacity.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="value-item">
              <img
                src="/images/corporate/value-innovation.webp"
                alt="Luminous modular technology cube"
                width="360"
                height="360"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              />
              <span><strong>Demand-gated capability</strong> Add technology to solve measured problems, not to fill a speculative equipment catalogue.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="value-item">
              <img
                src="/images/corporate/value-sustainability.webp"
                alt="Geometric green and blue leaf"
                width="360"
                height="360"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              />
              <span><strong>Subsistence before surplus</strong> Secure household food, preservation and propagation needs before agricultural sales.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="value-item">
              <img
                src="/images/corporate/value-integrity.webp"
                alt="Handshake set in a protective shield"
                width="360"
                height="360"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              />
              <span><strong>Clear separation</strong> Keep employment, corporate revenue, personal costs and each operating line explicitly documented.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-stats observe-slide-up">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-number">1</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Owner + legal entity</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-number">4</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Proposed operating names</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-number">2029</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Earliest customer launch</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-number">24 mo</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Base-case equipment payback gate</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    color: var(--corporate-accent-silver);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    letter-spacing: var(--letter-spacing-wider);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .legal-status {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--spacing-md);
    align-items: start;
    max-width: 1060px;
    margin: calc(var(--spacing-xl) * -1) auto var(--spacing-3xl);
    padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-xl);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 218, 220, 0.24);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: rgba(9, 30, 45, 0.62);
  }

  .status-dot {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    margin-top: 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--corporate-accent-blue);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(58, 134, 255, 0.13);
  }

  .legal-status p {
    margin: 0;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76);
    line-height: var(--line-height-loose);
  }

  .legal-status strong {
    color: white;
  }

  .about-paragraph--accent {
    padding: var(--spacing-lg);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--corporate-accent-blue);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;
    background: rgba(58, 134, 255, 0.08);
    color: white;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .legal-status {
      margin-top: 0;
      padding: var(--spacing-md);
    }
  }
</style>
